---
/* src/pages/index.astro */
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Arthur Doradoux | Engineering & Product Design">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section style="padding: 40px 0 70px;">
		<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 60px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
			<div style="flex: 1; min-width: 300px;">
				<div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
					<span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--emse-purple); padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--emse-purple); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(123, 31, 162, 0.08);">
						MINES SAINT-ÉTIENNE
					</span>
					<span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--pop-blue); padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--pop-blue); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.08);">
						POLITECNICO DI MILANO
					</span>
					<span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--emlyon-red); padding: 4px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--emlyon-red); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(230, 0, 40, 0.08);">
						EMLYON
					</span>
				</div>

				<h1 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -1px;">
					Arthur <em style="font-style: italic; color: var(--pop-fuchsia);">Doradoux</em>
				</h1>
				<p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px; max-width: 540px;">
					Microelectronics & Computer Science engineering student, bridging <span style="color: var(--pop-green); font-weight: 600;">deep tech hardware</span>, embedded systems, and <span style="color: var(--pop-fuchsia); font-weight: 600;">product design</span>[cite: 2].
				</p>
				
				<div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
					<a href="/projects" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pop-fuchsia), var(--pop-orange)); color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 55, 95, 0.3);">Explore Projects Hub →</a>
					<a href="mailto:arthur.doradoux@etu.emse.fr" style="background-color: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Get in touch</a>
				</div>

				<!-- Vrais Boutons CV -->
				<div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
					<span style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500;">Download Resume:</span>
					<a href="/assets/CV-Arthur_DORADOUX-ENG.pdf" download style="background: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.1); color: var(--pop-blue); border: 1px solid var(--pop-blue); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">English CV (PDF)</a>
					<a href="/assets/CV-Arthur_DORADOUX-FR.pdf" download style="background: rgba(105, 255, 10, 0.15); color: #2e8500; border: 1px solid var(--pop-green); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">CV Français (PDF)</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div style="position: relative; width: 280px; height: 350px; flex-shrink: 0; margin: 0 auto;">
				<img src="/assets/arthur.jpeg" alt="Arthur Doradoux" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius); position: relative; z-index: 2; box-shadow: var(--shadow);" />
				<div style="position: absolute; bottom: -14px; right: -14px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 2px solid var(--pop-green); border-radius: var(--radius); z-index: 1; opacity: 0.7;"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Profile & Ambitions Section -->
	<section style="padding: 40px 0;">
		<div class="stacked-title-wrapper">
			<div class="stacked-bg">Vision</div>
			<h2 class="stacked-main">Profile & Ambitions</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="card" style="padding: 36px; background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow);">
			<div style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
				<p>
					Currently an engineering student at <strong style="color: var(--emse-purple);">Mines Saint-Étienne (ISMIN)</strong>, I am building a profile at the intersection of <span style="color: var(--pop-blue); font-weight: 600;">engineering, design and management</span>[cite: 2]. My background in microelectronics and computer science has given me strong technical foundations through projects in embedded systems, hardware, processor architecture, and artificial intelligence[cite: 2].
				</p>
				<p>
					Over time, through both academic projects and student leadership experiences, I realized that what drives me most is not only the technical design of a system. I am equally interested in understanding <em style="color: var(--pop-green);">why</em> a technology is developed, <em style="color: var(--pop-orange);">for whom</em> it creates value, and <em style="color: var(--pop-fuchsia);">how</em> it can be turned into a relevant, coherent and impactful product[cite: 2].
				</p>
				<p>
					In the long term, my dream is to grow into <strong style="color: var(--pop-fuchsia);">Product Owner / Product Manager</strong> roles at the heart of technological innovation, bridging technical feasibility, user experience, and strategy[cite: 2].
				</p>
				<div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--pop-green); padding-left: 16px; margin: 10px 0; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; color: var(--text);">
					My goal is to build a genuine <strong>triple competency across engineering, design (via Politecnico di Milano) and management (via emlyon business school)</strong> to lead high-impact technological products[cite: 2].
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Experience Section -->
	<section style="padding: 40px 0;">
		<div class="stacked-title-wrapper">
			<div class="stacked-bg">Career</div>
			<h2 class="stacked-main">Experience</h2>
		</div>
		
		<div class="timeline">
			<div class="timeline-item">
				<div class="timeline-date">Apr — Jul 2026</div>
				<div class="timeline-content" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--pop-blue);">
					<span style="display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--pop-blue); margin-bottom: 2px;">R&D Test Cell Integration</span>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600;">Intern <em style="color: var(--pop-blue);">@ Advantest</em></h3>
					<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Böblingen, Germany[cite: 6]</p>
					<p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Testing calibration PCBs intended for AI/GPU chip testing, 3D modeling and printing of interface enclosures, and precision measurements using VNA and TDR[cite: 6].</p>
					<div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-green); color: var(--pop-green);">KiCAD</span>
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-blue); color: var(--pop-blue);">Hardware Design</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="timeline-item">
				<div class="timeline-date">Jan — Feb 2025</div>
				<div class="timeline-content" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--pop-orange);">
					<span style="display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--pop-orange); margin-bottom: 2px;">Hardware Systems Engineering</span>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600;">Intern <em style="color: var(--pop-orange);">@ PHINIA Delphi France</em></h3>
					<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Blois, France[cite: 6]</p>
					<p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Configuration and testing of injection systems, functional validation of ECUs for hydrogen-related applications, and thermal characterization after 12V to 24V adaptation[cite: 6].</p>
					<div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-orange); color: var(--pop-orange);">Embedded Systems</span>
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-purple); color: var(--pop-purple);">CAN</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Education Section -->
	<section style="padding: 40px 0;">
		<div class="stacked-title-wrapper">
			<div class="stacked-bg">Degrees</div>
			<h2 class="stacked-main">Education</h2>
		</div>
		
		<div class="timeline">
			<div class="timeline-item">
				<div class="timeline-date">2024 — 2027</div>
				<div class="timeline-content" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--emse-purple);">
					<span style="display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--emse-purple); margin-bottom: 2px;">Master’s Degree (ISMIN Program)</span>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600;">École Nationale Supérieure des <em style="color: var(--emse-purple);">Mines de Saint-Étienne</em></h3>
					<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Gardanne, France[cite: 6]</p>
					<p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Core curriculum covering microcontrollers, digital/analog electronics, embedded systems, CPU architecture, and cryptography[cite: 6]. Includes a specialized design semester at <strong style="color: var(--pop-blue);">Politecnico di Milano</strong> in the Master's Degree in Design & Engineering[cite: 2], followed by a double degree at <strong style="color: var(--emlyon-red);">emlyon business school</strong>[cite: 2].</p>
					<div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--emse-purple); color: var(--emse-purple);">Microelectronics</span>
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-blue); color: var(--pop-blue);">Design & Engineering</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="timeline-item">
				<div class="timeline-date">2022 — 2024</div>
				<div class="timeline-content" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--pop-yellow);">
					<span style="display: block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #D4AC0D; margin-bottom: 2px;">Intensive Scientific Courses (MPSI / MP*)</span>
					<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600;">Classes Préparatoires <em style="color: #D4AC0D;">Lycée Pothier</em></h3>
					<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Orléans, France[cite: 6]</p>
					<p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem;">Intensive scientific courses focused on advanced mathematics, physics, and computer science[cite: 6].</p>
					<div style="margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-yellow); color: #B7950B;">Mathematics</span>
						<span class="skill-tag" style="border-color: var(--pop-orange); color: var(--pop-orange);">Physics</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Featured Projects Preview -->
	<section style="padding: 40px 0 80px;">
		<div class="stacked-title-wrapper">
			<div class="stacked-bg">Selected</div>
			<h2 class="stacked-main">Featured Projects</h2>
		</div>

		<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
			<div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--pop-fuchsia); padding: 24px;">
				<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pop-fuchsia); text-transform: uppercase;">FPGA & Cryptography</span>
				<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 6px 0 10px;">FPGA ECG & ASCON Decryption</h3>
				<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">SystemVerilog architecture to process and decrypt secure ECG transmissions with a real-time Python dashboard[cite: 5].</p>
				<a href="/projects" style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pop-blue); text-decoration: none;">View in Projects Hub →</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--pop-green); padding: 24px;">
				<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pop-green); text-transform: uppercase;">IoT & Hardware</span>
				<h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 6px 0 10px;">Terrariot IoT Microclimate Box</h3>
				<p class="muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">Air quality monitoring enclosure using STM32, LoRaWAN connectivity, and custom 3D-printed enclosures for zoos[cite: 5].</p>
				<a href="/projects" style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--pop-blue); text-decoration: none;">View in Projects Hub →</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 32px;">
			<a href="/projects" style="display: inline-block; background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Browse Full Projects Hub →</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>